ALTER TABLE pudge RENAME COLUMN a TO b;
----
db error: ERROR: Column with name b already exists!


statement error
ALTER TABLE nonexistent RENAME COLUMN a TO b;
----
db error: ERROR: Table with name nonexistent does not exist!
<slt:ignore>


statement error
ALTER TABLE pudge RENAME COLUMN a TO a;
----
db error: ERROR: Cannot alter entry "pudge" because there are entries that depend on it.
table macro function "clickclack" depends on table "pudge".
view "pudge_view" depends on table "pudge".
Drop the dependent entries first and recreate them after the change.


